#. Description of the plugin
#: shooting-results.php
msgid "Fast, big-button competition results recording for shooting ranges — every score autosaves immediately, so a page refresh never loses data. Record results from any device on a password-protected page, and export an Excel report by email."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: shooting-results.php
msgid "Antti Mäkelä"
msgstr ""

